  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-484-510">囚人来る赤き衣の</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-510-522">囚人来る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-522-546"><rb>暴風</rb><rt>あらしの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-546-557">雨中を</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-557-595">荷へるをふとみむくれば、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-595-630">己を責む戒具と戒具と。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-630-654">人皆は恋の囚人、</seg></p>
    </body>
